mindmap
  root((Smart Pointers))
    unique_ptr
      Exclusive ownership
      Movable not copyable
      Zero overhead abstraction
      release, reset, get, swap
      Custom deleters in type
    shared_ptr
      Shared ownership
      Reference counting
      Control block allocation
      Atomic ref count ops
      make_shared for efficiency
    weak_ptr
      Non-owning weak reference
      Breaks circular references
      lock returns shared_ptr
      Detects object expiration
    Factory Functions
      make_unique - exception safe
      make_shared - single allocation
      Preferred over raw new
    Custom Deleters
      Non-memory resources
      FILE star, sockets, etc.
      "unique_ptr: type in signature"
      "shared_ptr: type erasure"
    Circular References
      "shared_ptr cycles = leak"
      "Fix: weak_ptr for back-refs"
      Common in graph structures
